  "Hazura Oujo desu ga, Konse wa Taikou Denka ni Aisareteimasu": [],
  "ハズレ王女ですが、今世は大公殿下に愛されています": [
   {
    "id": "7c9d6ef4-7a17-46b3-b2e7-870b474f2ab2",
    "type": "manga",
    "attributes": {
     "title": {
      "en": "Hazure Oujo desu ga, Imayo wa Taikou Denka ni Aisarete Imasu"
     },
     "altTitles": [
      {
       "ja": "ハズレ王女ですが、今世は大公殿下に愛されています"
      },
      {
       "en": "Although She Is a Failed Princess, She Is Loved by the Grand Duke in This Life"
      },
      {
       "en": "Although She Is a Loser Princess, She Is Loved by His Imperial Highness the Grand Duke in This Life"
      },
      {
       "en": "The Cast-off Princess Finds Love With the Grand Duke in This Life"
      },
      {
       "en": "The Forsaken Princess, Cherished by the Grand Duke"
      }
     ],
     "description": {
      "en": "Princess Saphir of the Kingdom of Emeraten was chosen as the fiancée of the Valoreia Empire’s crown prince. But from the very start, the political marriage was nothing but a cruel trap. Branded a murderer for a crime she did not commit, Saphir was imprisoned and subjected to endless torment. Longing only for release through death, she found it at the blade of the empire’s third prince, Leander. Yet her soul drifted for decades—until at last it returned to the very moment when all the tragedy first began. This time, she vows to seize her fate and uncover the true meaning behind the “freedom” Leander once granted her. As schemes and conspiracies rise anew within the perilous imperial court, can Saphir uncover the truth and break free from the cycle of despair? And what destiny awaits her and Leander? The reborn princess’s new song is about to begin.\n\n---\n**Original Web Serialization:**  \n• Manga: [ComicWalker](https://comic-walker.com/detail/KC_006836_S), [Kadokawa](https://www.kadokawa.co.jp/product/322501000579/), [NicoVideo](https://manga.nicovideo.jp/comic/73567)  \n• Webtoon: [MechaComic](https://mechacomic.jp/books/235123), [Piccoma](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/184692)",
      "ja": "廃妃の娘・サフィール王女は、国王の命により、敵国の皇太子・フィリックスと婚約することに。偽りの婚約だと知りつつも従うサフィール。実は彼女にとってこれは二度目の人生だった。前世では、恨みを持つフィリックスに徹底的に虐げられ、ようやく死をもって、その地獄から逃れたはずなのに…。前世の経験を活かし、同じ結末にならないように行動するサフィール。そのせいか、フィリックスの異母弟・レアンダー大公に気にかけられ、前世でも生き地獄から解放してくれたレアンダーに「ここから逃げたい」と本音を打ち明けてしまう――。助けを求めるのなら、大公殿下しかいない…?!"
     },
